# RULES.md - the binding rules for <PROJECT_NAME>

> **Meta-rule.** Part 1 changes only when the owner changes it, in writing, in
> this file. An agent may *propose* a change by opening a question; it may
> never edit Part 1. Part 2 changes when a measured failure teaches us
